WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.833
An essay describes a wall around Pataliputra. Who reported it?

2
00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:02.625
Ask from the sentence in TextEdit.

3
00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:04.125
Check the claim against the writer’s own reading notes.

4
00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:06.417
A saved reading note identifies Megasthenes as the diplomat who described the wall.

5
00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:07.583
Ask for the exact sentence.

6
00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:10.875
The exact sentence attributes a wooden wall with 64 gates and 570 towers to Megasthenes.

7
00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:13.083
Check the attribution against the original reading note.

8
00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:14.875
Attribute the claim in the draft.

9
00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:16.875
The revised opening reads “Megasthenes described a wooden wall around Pataliputra, Chandragupta Maurya’s capital.”
